@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.TeamRizaModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Riza Agung Pribadi";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Our Team</p>
                <h2>Riza Agung Pribadi</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A finance team member who sees inclusion not as helping from a distance,
                    but as building real access so that everyone can connect.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Finance</span>
                    <span>Access</span>
                    <span>Inclusion</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="team-profile-hero-img reveal">
                <img src="/images/team/riza.jpg" alt="Riza Agung Pribadi">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">His Perspective</p>
                <h3>Access That Is Often Overlooked</h3>

                <p>
                    For Riza, working with Deaf friends is not just about collaboration—
                    it is about opening access that is often overlooked.
                </p>

                <p>
                    One of his most memorable experiences was accompanying Deaf friends
                    to learn about coffee directly at Wonosantri Coffee Plantation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>His Role</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Finance</li>
                    <li>Behind-the-scenes support</li>
                    <li>Program sustainability</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Meaning</p>
                <h3>Quiet Work, Real Impact</h3>

                <p>
                    In finance, Riza manages the parts that often remain unseen,
                    but are essential to keep every step and every program moving.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Through that role, he realized that impact does not always have to be visible.
                    Sometimes it grows quietly, but still makes a real difference.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">His Message</p>
                <h3>Start with a Small Step</h3>

                <p>
                    Riza encourages hearing people not to be afraid
                    to start communicating with Deaf friends.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Because from that small step,
                    people begin to understand and open access to information
                    that has long been limited.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>His Reflection</h3>
            <p>
                For Riza, inclusion is not about helping—
                it is about ensuring everyone can connect.
            </p>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Team</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>